note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note seed/build/gpucoord.om: Pure seeded-Omega GPU SPIR-V, Intel Xe & Model Package Build Coordinator.
note Replaces:
note   gpu/spirv/omega-run.sh     -> om-gpucoord spirv-run KERNEL ENV
note   gpu/spirv/check.sh         -> om-gpucoord spirv-check
note   gpu/intel/gate.sh          -> om-gpucoord intel-gate
note   om/gpu/spec/build.sh       -> om-gpucoord build-spec OUTDIR
note   om/gpu/dsv41/build.sh      -> om-gpucoord build-dsv41 OUTDIR
note   om/gpu/inkling2/build.sh   -> om-gpucoord build-inkling2 OUTDIR
note Zero shell, zero Python, zero sed/dd/mktemp.
note Build: cat seed/build/common.om seed/build/gpucoord.om | seed/out/omc > build/om-gpucoord

